{"doc":"DOC_LEAVE_001","doc_id":"DOC_LEAVE_001","page":1,"chunk":0,"text":"リフレッシュ休暇は勤続5年から対象で、慰労金を支給する。","dept":"hr","labels":["leave","policy"],"label":"leave","updated_at":"2026-02-01","confidentiality":"internal"}
{"doc":"DOC_LEAVE_001","doc_id":"DOC_LEAVE_001","page":2,"chunk":1,"text":"リフレッシュ休暇の申請は所定の申請書を所属長に提出して承認を得る。","dept":"hr","labels":["leave","policy"],"label":"leave","updated_at":"2026-02-01","confidentiality":"internal"}
{"doc":"DOC_TRAVEL_001","doc_id":"DOC_TRAVEL_001","page":1,"chunk":0,"text":"国内出張は経費精算システムで出張申請し、決裁者承認後に実施する。","dept":"hr","labels":["travel","policy"],"label":"travel","updated_at":"2026-02-01","confidentiality":"internal"}
{"doc":"DOC_TRAVEL_001","doc_id":"DOC_TRAVEL_001","page":2,"chunk":1,"text":"国内出張旅費では宿泊料上限と日当を等級別に定める。","dept":"hr","labels":["travel","policy"],"label":"travel","updated_at":"2026-02-01","confidentiality":"internal"}
{"doc":"DOC_TRAVEL_002","doc_id":"DOC_TRAVEL_002","page":1,"chunk":0,"text":"海外出張では海外出張申請書を提出し、帰国後に精算書で精算する。","dept":"hr","labels":["travel","policy"],"label":"travel","updated_at":"2026-02-01","confidentiality":"internal"}
{"doc":"DOC_FAQ_001","doc_id":"DOC_FAQ_001","page":1,"chunk":0,"text":"ハイブリッドワークFAQでは時差勤務や同日出社の扱いを説明する。","dept":"hr","labels":["faq"],"label":"faq","updated_at":"2026-02-01","confidentiality":"internal"}
{"doc":"DOC_COMP_001","doc_id":"DOC_COMP_001","page":1,"chunk":0,"text":"給与規程は賃金体系、等級、支給日、控除を定める。","dept":"hr","labels":["compensation","policy"],"label":"compensation","updated_at":"2026-02-01","confidentiality":"internal"}
{"doc":"DOC_COMP_002","doc_id":"DOC_COMP_002","page":1,"chunk":0,"text":"退職金規程は退職金の支給条件と算定基準を定める。","dept":"hr","labels":["compensation","policy"],"label":"compensation","updated_at":"2026-02-01","confidentiality":"internal"}
{"doc":"DOC_POLICY_001","doc_id":"DOC_POLICY_001","page":1,"chunk":0,"text":"就業規則は労働条件、服務規律、勤務時間、休暇を定める。","dept":"hr","labels":["policy"],"label":"policy","updated_at":"2026-02-01","confidentiality":"internal"}
{"doc":"DOC_POLICY_002","doc_id":"DOC_POLICY_002","page":1,"chunk":0,"text":"慶弔見舞金規程は支給事由と金額を定義する。","dept":"hr","labels":["policy"],"label":"policy","updated_at":"2026-02-01","confidentiality":"internal"}
{"doc":"DOC_POLICY_003","doc_id":"DOC_POLICY_003","page":1,"chunk":0,"text":"安全衛生管理規程は安全衛生体制と責任を定める。","dept":"hr","labels":["policy"],"label":"policy","updated_at":"2026-02-01","confidentiality":"internal"}
{"doc":"DOC_POLICY_004","doc_id":"DOC_POLICY_004","page":1,"chunk":0,"text":"社員小口貸付金制度は貸付対象と返済条件を定める。","dept":"hr","labels":["policy"],"label":"policy","updated_at":"2026-02-01","confidentiality":"internal"}
